  "description": "The Nomad version of the Weekender is made to travel. While it can easily handle being a weekday commuter on rough city roads, it really shines when you take it for a long haul.\n\nThe Weekender Nomad’s 100% 4130 chromoly frame and fork will welcome virtually anything that you can throw at it. This is our top of the line Weekender, and it comes equipped with an amazing parts build, like a SRAM Rival 1x derailleur and shifter, Avid disc brakes, FSA cranks and Continental semi-knobby tires.\n\nThe Nomad features the Weekender’s redesigned geometry that is built around 27.5 x 2.0” tires, and also leaves plenty of space for compatibility with 700c wheels if you ever feel like changing it up.\n\nAvailable in Royal Blue in Small, Medium, Large, and X-Large sizes.\n\nFSA Gossamer stem/seat post\n\nFSA NS Adventure bars\n\nFSA Gossamer Compact MegaExo 1x crank\n\nSRAM Rival 1x Long Cage 11 speed rear derailleur\n\nContinental Double Fighter tires\n\n(Maxxis Overdrive tires for XS & Small sizes)\n\n650b stock wheels with 700c compatibility\n\n(for Medium, Large, and XL sizes only)\n\nNarrow-Wide sprocket\n\nAvid BB7 disc brakes",
